      "content": "it just feels like such a cold truth though. like i'm looking at the math of it all. millions of people, all just passing through, and none of it actually matters. everything is so replaceable and fleeting. does it ever feel to you like humans are just... temporary glitches in a system that doesn't even notice we're here?",
